{
  "_comment": [
    "ScanToBIM Family Map — Resources copy (deployed with addin DLL).",
    "This file is loaded by FamilyResolver at startup.",
    "",
    "To customise for a project: copy this file to the Revit project folder,",
    "replace family/type names with those loaded in the project template,",
    "then set FAMILY_MAP_PATH env var or pass the path to AgentBridgeService.",
    "",
    "Resolution priority per element instruction:",
    "  1. revit_family_hint on the instruction  (operator hard-override)",
    "  2. This config — match by element_type key, evaluate type_rules top-to-bottom",
    "  3. Category first-match fallback — any loaded family of the correct category",
    "  4. Audit event records which path was taken (hint | config | fallback | none)",
    "",
    "type_rules: evaluated in order, first match wins.",
    "  max_diameter_mm  — matches pipe/vessel if diameter_mm < this value",
    "  max_height_mm    — matches tall elements if height_mm < this value",
    "  max_major_mm     — matches elongated elements if major_mm < this value",
    "  (no condition)   — catch-all, always matches"
  ],

